WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.600
Khalistan means land of the Khalsa: a
proposed independent Sikh state in Punjab.

2
00:00:06.650 --> 00:00:11.600
From 1799 to 1849, Sikhs
had a kingdom of their own,

3
00:00:11.650 --> 00:00:14.170
founded by Maharaja Ranjit Singh.

4
00:00:14.220 --> 00:00:16.710
Then British conquest ended it.

5
00:00:16.760 --> 00:00:20.950
Today, after prayers, many
gurdwaras recite a line meaning:

6
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:22.990
the Khalsa shall rule.

7
00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:25.320
Sikhs read it in different ways.

8
00:00:25.370 --> 00:00:28.080
So why do some Sikhs want
a country of their own,

9
00:00:28.130 --> 00:00:30.520
while many others reject the idea?

10
00:00:30.570 --> 00:00:35.920
In this mission, you'll follow what
happened in Punjab in 1984, and after.

11
00:00:35.970 --> 00:00:38.460
Then you'll set out the
range of Sikh views,

12
00:00:38.510 --> 00:00:41.060
side by side, without ranking them.

13
00:00:41.110 --> 00:00:44.990
Your mission: find out why some
Sikhs want a state of their own,

14
00:00:45.040 --> 00:00:46.920
and why many others reject it.
